MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_ZEVLab_opening
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 0
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.opening.00
    DefaultText: "실습이라면서요. 의뢰서까지 써야 하나요?"
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.opening.01
    DefaultText: "구두 계약도 계약입니다. 준비는 되셨습니까?"
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.opening.02
    DefaultText: "준비됐다는 말은 안 했는데요."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.opening.03
    DefaultText: "그럼 자세부터 보여 드리겠습니다. 빛나는 순간을 보십시오."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.opening.04
    DefaultText: "좋아요. 대신 치료비는 실습비에 포함입니다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
